<i>happiness if they make it into Tokyo U.</i>

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.060
<i>Believing in that promise,</i>
<i>I applied to Tokyo U.</i>

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.900
<i>And I'm still studying away</i>
<i>after three failures...</i>

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:50.900
I don't need that mopey
introduction anymore!

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:55.170
When I became manager of an all-girls'
dorm, I thought I'd found happiness,

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:58.910
but what awaited me was days of being
punched, kicked and worked like a slave...

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:01.110
But now, I've finally
made it into Tokyo U!

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:01.810
Oh, my...

