00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.970
Tokyo U Power!

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.000
He's so dashing!

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.340
He's such a spaz.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.930
May

