00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.980
Sorry, today's no good for me.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:07.570
Keitaro!

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:09.060
Got your business at home
taken care of?.

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:10.870
Party, party!

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:12.840
Welcome back, Mr. Urashima!

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.850
Yeah, everything's fine now.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.820
You jerk...
