00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:20.500
July

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.780
- Yay!
- Yahoo!

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.150
Have Fun Abroad!

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.380
Thanks for seeing
