00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:37.620
Narusegawa?

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.320
W-What are you doing here?!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.790
They had to do some extra maintenance,
so the flight was delayed.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.300
I felt embarrassed about going back
