Mr. Seta, that's all.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.780
I see.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.270
Narusegawa.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:10.550
Narusegawa, I realized something when
I saw Nyamo back on Pararakelse Island,

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.990
I realized that I really didn't
have any dreams of my own.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.230
That's why...

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:17.890
Listen...

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:19.760
I love you!
About what I said back at Christmas...

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:20.460
About what I said back at Christmas...

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:27.330
