00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.040
Well, I'd better get going.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.350
And now, late August...

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.700
So, this is Hinata Apartments...

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:08.010
Hello!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.010
Oh, my...

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:12.140
