00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.840
Um, Ms. Naru...

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:46.620
Haven't you heard anything
from Mr. Urashima yet?

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:50.480
Huh? Shinobu, we're
studying right now.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.680
