""I <i>might</i> like him.""

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.890
That's right, there was
definitely a ""might"" in there.

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:29.250
I don't add words like
""might"" to what I say.

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:30.880
Oh, I see.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:32.990
Ms. Naru, that's not fair!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.900
