hasn't come back here!

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:40.730
I'm sorry!

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:41.930
I'm sorry!

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:43.110
I just...

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.270
