you know, meow?

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:14.500
Meow?

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.710
A moment of your time, ladies!

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:26.810
Two guys, one skinny,
one chubby, both with glasses...

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.250
Hey! Wait!
They're not listening...

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:31.290
Let's go home.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.020
You idiot!

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:35.890
