anything special happening?!

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.750
Hm? I'm getting a signal
on my babe alert radar!

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:41.360
Hello?

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.730
I have a friend that's
a Tokyo U student.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:44.890
Would you like to help us
put together a party?

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.800
You never change.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:49.970
M-Motoko...

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:52.570
The way you're acting, you're
even lower than Urashima.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:53.970
