didn't notice this...

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.060
Oh, hello, Motoko!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.000
Motoko, you're applying
to Tokyo U, too?

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:21.610
You're trying for the same
school as Keitaro?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.800
Um, no... It's just that if I'm
to take an entrance exam,

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.280
