the toughest one.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.640
Naturally.

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:32.870
Because you don't have any feelings
at all for Keitaro, isn't that right?

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.110
O-Of course not...

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.210
Wh-What are you doing?

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:41.020
Motoko, I thought you
didn't like wearing skirts.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.450
