00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.150
C'mon, now...

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.990
You keep going at it
like that, and I'll...

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:31.140
Your breasts are <i>huge...</i>
Who massages them for you?

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.870
N-None of your business!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:35.940
About this big?

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.580
What the hell
are you doing?!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.980
Oh, that reminds me.
You're behind on your rent.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.150
Pay it off, all right?

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.310
What?!

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:44.780
Naru!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:48.220
My room's been cleaned out!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:52.360
All the toys I'd stashed away
for pulling pranks are gone, too!.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.670
I threw all that junk out
with the non-burnable garbage.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:56.800
What?!

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:59.030
That was mean, Naru!

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.300
If you have a problem with it,
feel free to leave.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.940
Um, Ms. Naru,
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.180
Huh? Is it just me,
or are your breasts--

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:22.180
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:25.460
Shinobu, what happened to
your teddy bear panties?

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.290
I-I don't wear childish
stuff like that anymore!

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:32.470
And yet you still wear strawberry prints.
Seems very childish to <i>me.</i>

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:35.930
I'm not a child!

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:39.200
Shinobu, if you want
to be more grown up,

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.740
