things like <i>this!</i>

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.580
Oh, dear. I see your breasts
haven't filled out yet...

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:51.380
304:
Naru Narusegawa

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.000
Oh, my, Ms. Naru...

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:15.700
What are you doing?

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:19.540
M-Ms. Mutsumi, don't wander
around stark naked like that!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.150
I'm a bit lightheaded from
staying in the hot spring too long...

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:29.360
M-Ms. Mutsumi, didn't you
have a letter earlier?

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.360
A letter?

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:35.290
Oh, now that you mention it,
I did! Now, where did I put it?

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.660
If you're not going
to tell me, then...

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:39.400
Hey, it's Naru!

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:40.690
She's back!

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:43.240
What...? What's this all about?!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:44.540
Somebody help me!

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:45.600
Oh, my!
Somebody help me!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.210
