never do what she did today!

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.250
Electron laser! Fire!

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.530
<i>W-What are they</i>
<i>all talking about?!</i>

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.500
<i>I just got home, and I have no idea</i>
<i>what they're talking about!</i>

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.400
How dare you rob me
of my chastity!

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:16.700
Secret Attack!
Thunder Clap Blade, <i>Ni-no-tachi!</i>

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.610
Oh, that hurts...

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.090
Ow!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:35.620
Keitaro, help me!

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:37.720
Right, you're not here...

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.740
Me? Why?
No way...

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:00.880
I don't believe it!
T-That's Keitaro's shirt!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:04.610
Why am I holding it tight
like that? What a dope!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:09.380
I'm not some pervert that thinks
his <i>smell</i> is romantic! No, no!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.260
Huh? Me?

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.490
I'm <i>here,</i> so that means...

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.290
I'm Naru.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.760
What? How can this be?!

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:21.570
Because I love Keitaro.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.710
And the truth is,
I want him all to myself.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.830
I think everyone else
is just in the way.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.610
No, no, no!

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.580
I don't think like that!
His shirt just smells funny to me!

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:40.390
Quickly, get into this!

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:41.520
Wha--?

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.380
I'll hide you, me.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.060
Thanks, me!

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.100
It's too small...

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:53.270
Hurry up and get in!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.640
But it's a tight fit!

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:59.370
Let me fill you in
on something, Naru.

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:02.740
His promise girl?
That was <i>me.</i>

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:08.990
There she is!

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:10.450
Hold it, Naru!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.290
You won't catch me
<i>that</i> easily!

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.020
Somebody help me! Let me out of here!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.490
Wait, that fighting stance is--
Somebody help me! Let me out of here!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:16.380
Can anybody hear me?!

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.170
What's with those moves?!

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:32.240
She's like a totally different person!

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:39.210
I've just gotten sick of living under
the same roof as the likes of you.

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:44.190
If you want to stop me, you'll have to resort
to brute force and <i>throw</i> me out.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.980
- Throw you out?
- Why?

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.020
This is the same cops and robbers
game we always play!

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:53.450
In that case, I'll make you <i>want</i>
to throw me out, no matter what!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.320
What's the commotion
about <i>this</i> time?

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.430
Everyone!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.960
That... me... is a... fake!

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:02.100
T-There are two Ms. Narus!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.610
Which is the real one?

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:05.130
Can't you tell
just by looking?!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.880
She's got the lower body
of a raccoon dog..

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:13.210
<i>That's</i> the real one!

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:15.480
And you call yourself
my best friend?!

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.350
Ms. Naru...!

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:20.020
I found the letter!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:22.690
It was buried under some watermelons
on the kotatsu table!

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.590
Oh, dear. Which Ms. Naru
should I give this to?

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.120
Letter?

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.490
Ms. Mutsumi!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.400
I'm free!

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:49.650
Oh, the letter from Keitaro...

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:53.860
Wait a minute...
Are you Kanako?

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:55.320
Kanako?

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:05.360
I came here disguised like this
to gather information on all of you.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.440
I'm the new manager
here at Hinata Apartments.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:25.490
I'm Kanako Urashima.
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:28.690
The new...

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.020
...manager?!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.890
What about Urashima?
What happened to him?!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.960
Kanako Urashima?

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:36.990
She's Keitaro's younger sister.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:39.930
Last I heard, she was traveling
with our grandmother...

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.170
Oh, she's his sister...

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:51.680
<i>You</i> take it from here.
That kid and I are like oil and water.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.450
Hang in there, Naru.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:56.420
Wha--? Ms. Haruka!

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.480
We won't stand for this.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.950
Come out of nowhere and claim
to be the apartment manager?

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:03.120
This is awfully inconsiderate!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.260
What about the dropout?

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.760
This cat sure is cute, though...

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.430
Isn't it?

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:14.930
Anyone who doesn't care for this
arrangement is welcome to leave.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.160
<i>After</i> paying the rent.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.430
What?!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.500
W-Wait, everyone.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:23.370
Don't you think Keitaro's sister would
be qualified to be our apartment manager?

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.950
What's the deal, Naru?
Are you taking her side?

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.350
This fiend disguised herself
as you, Ms. Naru, and she--

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.750
But when Keitaro
comes back,

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.260
I think Keitaro would be thrilled
to see his little sister here!

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.760
That's true, but...

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:39.250
She <i>is</i> his sister...

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:42.130
If Naru says she's okay,
I guess I can live with it.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:44.060
Then you're gonna live here?

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.060
This is gonna be fun!

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:49.830
Excuse me.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.400
Um, hey, if you have
any questions...

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.750
Kissing up to me
won't change anything.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:21:01.350
Once I become manager, big brother will
no longer have any reason to return to you.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:07.050
Manager:
Keitaro Urashima

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:14.870
Something about this Naru Narusegawa
bothers you, meow?

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.000
What a fool.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.270
I came here to drive
Narusegawa out,

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:23.940
and yet <i>she</i> is the one
who stood up for me.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.910
But the last time anyone stood up
for you was when <i>he</i> did.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:29.040
Shut up, Kuro.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:36.080
T-The cat... It <i>talked?</i>

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.320
The cat can talk!

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:40.580
And it can fly!

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:43.690
- Timely Rent Payment Please
- Conserve Water in Bathroom

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:45.160
- Lights out at <i>9</i> PM
- No Drinking Alcohol

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.260
- No Gambling Permitted
- No Wandering in Underwear

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.500
Walk on the right side of the hall

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.400
Walk on the right side of the hall
Um, excuse me...

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:52.030
Um, excuse me...

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:53.070
Can I help you?

00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:57.200
Miss Urashima... Your brother
wasn't this strict.

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:00.110
I know my brother
better than anyone!

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:05.210
My big brother had me take charge
because he'd had enough of you.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:09.220
These are the other, more detailed rules
that I couldn't write out as notices.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:11.020
Hinata Apartment Occupant Contract
These are the other, more detailed rules
that I couldn't write out as notices.

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:13.220
Hinata Apartment Occupant Contract

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:21.820
Kanako was the girl Keitaro
made his promise to?

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:26.430
Then she's the one he's supposed
to go to Tokyo U with?

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:32.730
<i>So that's why Keitaro went to</i>
<i>Tokyo U? Not because of me?</i>

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:37.170
<i>But they're brother and sister, so</i>--

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:46.350
The cutoff for bath usage
is 8 PM sharp.

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:50.160
K-Kanako...!

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:51.530
Wait a minute!

00:22:57.770 --> 00:22:59.360
What's wrong, everyone?

00:23:00.300 --> 00:23:01.500
Oh, Naru!

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:03.900
We're gonna go find
Kanako's weak spot!

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:05.470
Weak spot?

00:23:07.610 --> 00:23:09.100
Please look at this.

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:13.470
She has added various special rules
to the occupant contract.

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:18.950
""Access to the abandoned annex on the
mountainside is forbidden in perpetuity.""

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:22.920
""Should any occupant be found inside,
said occupant will be evicted forthwith...""

00:23:23.530 --> 00:23:24.760
What's this about?

00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:28.200
I thought that abandoned annex
was just some crumbling ruin,

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:32.140
but if she's going this far to keep us out,
there must be something special inside.

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:34.930
I've been meaning
to explore it, anyway.

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:37.400
But it's already dark...

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:39.810
Shinobu and Sara?
You, too?

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:45.080
I... I think doing bad things is bad, even
if it's Mr. Urashima's sister that's doing it.

00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:46.450
And she's got
that monster cat!

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:47.710
Monster cat?

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:52.890
If Kanako sticks around here like this,
Keitaro will never come back.

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:57.390
If we determine Kanako's weakness,
Urashima will certainly return.

00:23:58.660 --> 00:23:59.890
Keitaro...?

00:24:00.030 --> 00:24:01.620
All right, let's head out!

00:24:01.670 --> 00:24:02.890
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:06.170
Hey, wait!
C'mon!

00:24:13.410 --> 00:24:15.740
Thank you for telling
me this, Ms. Naru.

00:24:15.780 --> 00:24:21.270
Don't get me wrong! I just wanted you
and the others to get along better.

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:25.550
To keep things from getting
even more strained.

00:24:27.990 --> 00:24:32.290
Ms. Naru... W-Why are you
being so nice to me?

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:35.830
Well, because you're
Keitaro's little sister!

00:24:36.600 --> 00:24:38.730
Please stop referring to him by his
first name as if you're close.

00:24:38.900 --> 00:24:41.960
Are you and my big brother
involved somehow?

00:24:44.410 --> 00:24:47.280
N-No, not really!

00:24:49.210 --> 00:24:53.270
I suppose I'm more sensitive because
I have a younger sister myself.

00:24:53.550 --> 00:24:57.510
You know, to how a younger sister would
look up to her big brother and stuff.

00:24:57.650 --> 00:25:00.990
In my case, we're only stepsisters,
so we're not related by blood.

00:25:01.030 --> 00:25:02.120
That's just like us.

00:25:02.160 --> 00:25:03.390
Huh? What is?

00:25:03.460 --> 00:25:06.790
Big brother and I are
siblings by marriage, too.

00:25:07.130 --> 00:25:08.290
W- <i>What?!</i>

00:25:08.530 --> 00:25:10.000
Which is why...

00:25:10.930 --> 00:25:14.170
...I will carry out my promise
with big brother.

00:25:20.410 --> 00:25:22.110
I found this underground.

00:25:22.880 --> 00:25:24.780
These are my weapons.

00:25:24.980 --> 00:25:27.040
Those are the guys that were
multiplying below the--

00:25:30.850 --> 00:25:32.290
There it is!
The annex!

00:25:41.700 --> 00:25:43.500
What do you think
you're doing?

00:25:43.800 --> 00:25:46.000
Haven't I told you that the
annex is a dangerous place?

00:25:46.570 --> 00:25:47.400
Ms. Haruka...

00:25:47.440 --> 00:25:48.430
We're sorry!

00:25:50.870 --> 00:25:52.040
Su, hit it!

00:25:52.040 --> 00:25:52.840
Gotcha!

00:25:53.610 --> 00:25:56.310
Developed for just such
an emergency...!

00:25:57.050 --> 00:25:58.840
The See-all Light!

00:26:05.820 --> 00:26:06.650
Now!

00:26:07.290 --> 00:26:08.320
Evil Splitting Blade!

00:26:19.670 --> 00:26:21.430
Continue interfering with us
at your own peril.

00:26:22.470 --> 00:26:24.310
I will <i>not</i> let you
into the annex.

00:26:24.310 --> 00:26:25.240
Go!

00:26:28.710 --> 00:26:30.370
Yay! Mecha-Tamas!

00:26:30.410 --> 00:26:31.680
Stop cheering!

00:26:32.880 --> 00:26:35.550
Turtles, turtles, turtles!

00:26:35.620 --> 00:26:38.050
Kaolla! Do something!

00:26:40.420 --> 00:26:44.190
Kanako, you're just like Keitaro!
You wanna play with us!

00:26:44.760 --> 00:26:45.890
I'm not playing.

00:26:46.330 --> 00:26:47.320
Finish them!

00:26:49.370 --> 00:26:52.200
Kanako! Everyone!
Please stop!

00:26:54.240 --> 00:26:57.970
Ms. Naru... So, I see you're
not on my side, after all.

00:26:58.940 --> 00:27:01.810
Huh? Whose side are
you on here, Naru?

00:27:02.480 --> 00:27:03.450
It's just that...

00:27:04.750 --> 00:27:05.680
Um...

00:27:06.580 --> 00:27:11.450
So, what did the letter
from Keitaro say?

00:27:12.690 --> 00:27:15.090
Hey, right! Now that you mention it,
I'd completely forgotten about it.

00:27:15.230 --> 00:27:17.850
Ms. Kanako, what did it say?

00:27:18.130 --> 00:27:19.220
Well...

00:27:20.660 --> 00:27:22.630
I'd also forgotten
to read it.

00:27:31.740 --> 00:27:33.510
Hey, is that the Setamobile?!

00:27:33.610 --> 00:27:36.270
I just got my license, and driving on the left
side of the street is so new to me...

00:27:36.380 --> 00:27:38.440
Boy, I royally screwed up.

00:27:38.880 --> 00:27:41.750
Okay, now...
C'mon, why isn't this opening?

00:27:50.230 --> 00:27:51.920
Hey, everybody.
Long time no see.

00:27:52.360 --> 00:27:54.800
Keitaro Urashima
is back home!

00:27:56.700 --> 00:27:57.690
Huh?

00:27:58.370 --> 00:28:02.030
Didn't I mention in my letter
that I was coming back today?

00:28:02.910 --> 00:28:04.460
What's wrong, guys?

00:28:05.740 --> 00:28:07.180
KEITARO!

00:28:13.050 --> 00:28:17.850
Daremoga isoideiru machi no naka,
In this city where everyone is rushing about,

00:28:18.120 --> 00:28:22.990
sukoshi yukkuri aruite mita.
I tried walking a little more slowly.

00:28:23.260 --> 00:28:28.860
Koe ni dasanai negai,
This wish I can't voice,

00:28:29.000 --> 00:28:34.030
anata to nara kanaetai yo.
I'd like to make it come true with you.

00:28:34.070 --> 00:28:39.910
Tokidoki nakitakunaruto,
When I want to start crying,

00:28:39.940 --> 00:28:49.250
me wo tojite kou omouno, ""Try!""
I close my eyes and say to myself, ""Try!""

00:28:49.290 --> 00:28:54.920
Dakedo anata ga iru, ai wo motomete iru.
But you're here, you're longing for love.

00:28:55.290 --> 00:28:57.920
Futari nara,
With the two of us,

00:28:57.960 --> 00:29:03.330
yasashii namida ni kawaru,
I'm sure it will turn into tears of kindness,

00:29:03.800 --> 00:29:08.500
yume wa kitto kanau.
and our dreams will come true.
